# Example MPI hostfile for the IFI cluster.
# Create the real `hostfile` from `/share/ifi/available-nodes.sh` output,
# using the SAME format that script prints. One node per line; `slots=` is
# the number of processes to place on that node (keep <= physical cores to
# avoid oversubscription). Example:
#
# compute-1-1.local slots=8
# compute-1-2.local slots=8
